  "subject": "A woman who always steps off the kerb with exactly three seconds left on the pedestrian green-man countdown mistimes it once, and the man waiting at the corner holds up his hand to stop a scooter for her.",
  "caption": "Twinkly midwest-emo indie rock. Clean electric guitar playing interlocking two-hand tapped arpeggios with a dotted delay, a second guitar with light overdrive entering on choruses, melodic electric bass moving under the guitars, live drum kit with open hi-hat. Raw live-room recording with gentle ambience. Female vocal, clear mid register, earnest slightly strained delivery, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 118 BPM, E major. Wistful, hopeful, restless mood. No synth, no horns, no electronic drums, no autotune, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n逐工透早八點，我行到彼个路口\n紅燈欲變青，人群擠做伙\n我袂曉等，我愛揣空縫\n賰三秒，我才踏落去\n[Pre-Chorus]\n三，二，一，我攏踏準\n車仔的喇叭，我當做鼓聲\n[Chorus]\n賰三秒，賰三秒\n我的步，攏拍佇彼个所在\n賰三秒，賰三秒\n路口彼个人，攏看會著\n[Verse]\n今仔日鞋帶鬆去，我慢一步\n綠燈閃，伊猶行來\n一台機車衝過來，煞袂著\n伊手舉懸，擋佇我前面\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我的心跳，比倒數較緊\n伊的手，無放落來\n[Chorus]\n賰三秒，賰三秒\n我的步，這擺踏毋準\n賰三秒，賰三秒\n伊的名，我猶毋知\n[Verse]\n隔工我較早到，企佇伊的邊仔\n紅燈亮，我無想欲逃\n伊笑講：「今仔日，你敢無趕？」\n[Bridge]\n三，二，一，毋免數\n人群行過，我留落來\n[Chorus]\n賰三秒，賰三秒\n這擺我愛慢慢仔行\n賰三秒，賰三秒\n路口彼个人，同款共我等\n[Outro]\n紅燈變青，倒數開始\n我的步，予伊配合",
